<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Payment Failed - Action Required</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EF4444 0%, #DC2626 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .warning-icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .payment-details {
      background: #FEF2F2;
      border-left: 4px solid #EF4444;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .payment-details h2 {
      margin: 0 0 15px 0;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #DC2626;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #FEE2E2;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #7F1D1D;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #1E293B;
    }
    .action-box {
      background: #FEF3C7;
      border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .action-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      color: #92400E;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #EF4444;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: #DC2626;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="warning-icon">⚠</div>
      <h1>Payment Failed - Action Required</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{familyName}},</p>

      <p>We're writing to inform you that a recent payment attempt was unsuccessful.</p>

      <div class="payment-details">
        <h2>Failed Payment Details</h2>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Amount:</span>
          <span class="detail-value" style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #DC2626;">{{paymentAmount}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Invoice Number:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">#{{invoiceNumber}}</span>
        </div>
        {{#if failureReason}}
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Reason:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{failureReason}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
      </div>

      <div class="action-box">
        <h3>What happens next?</h3>
        {{#if retryDate}}
        <p>We will automatically attempt to collect this payment again on <strong>{{retryDate}}</strong>.</p>
        <p>Please ensure you have sufficient funds in your account before this date.</p>
        {{else}}
        <p>Please contact us to arrange payment or update your payment details.</p>
        {{/if}}
      </div>

      {{#if hasSpecificFailureReason}}
      <p><strong>Why did this payment fail?</strong></p>
      <p>{{failureReason}}</p>
      {{else}}
      <p><strong>Common reasons for payment failures:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Insufficient funds in your account</li>
        <li>Cancelled or expired Direct Debit mandate</li>
        <li>Incorrect bank details</li>
        <li>Bank security restrictions</li>
      </ul>
      {{/if}}

      <p>If you believe this is an error or need assistance, please contact us as soon as possible.</p>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{appUrl}}/invoices" class="button">View Your Invoices</a>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Best regards,<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
